    "detailed_description": "<strong>About this game</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/81824fed050604ee9b2be68dc0ba7146.poster.avif?t=1725285365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/81824fed050604ee9b2be68dc0ba7146.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/81824fed050604ee9b2be68dc0ba7146.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Body-swapping with your dog, and live its dream! <br><br><br><strong>Game Story</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/8518b63b96a7e6bb176aa45849e5db73.poster.avif?t=1725285365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/8518b63b96a7e6bb176aa45849e5db73.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/8518b63b96a7e6bb176aa45849e5db73.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Ever wondered what a day in your dog's life is like? Meet John and his beloved border collie, Cole. On this New Year's Eve, something peculiar happens. John dozes off on Cole's cozy dog bed and wakes up...as Cole himself --- as a dog! <br><br><br><strong>Interactions</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/5f4efed7fa4c507d44757b23ab067273.poster.avif?t=1725285365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/5f4efed7fa4c507d44757b23ab067273.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/5f4efed7fa4c507d44757b23ab067273.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Sniff, bark, beg, and use the paw to interact with the townfolks. Perform tricks to forge meaningful connections along the way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/ef9376e1c861f665a61ac0c42f184608.poster.avif?t=1725285365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/ef9376e1c861f665a61ac0c42f184608.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/ef9376e1c861f665a61ac0c42f184608.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Sniff it out like a dog!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/bae791573f4b841e53ce581692c26bb0.poster.avif?t=1725285365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/bae791573f4b841e53ce581692c26bb0.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/bae791573f4b841e53ce581692c26bb0.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take care of your human... play together!",
