.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/5f4efed7fa4c507d44757b23ab067273.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/5f4efed7fa4c507d44757b23ab067273.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Sniff, bark, beg, and use the paw to interact with the townfolks. Perform tricks to forge meaningful connections along the way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/ef9376e1c861f665a61ac0c42f184608.poster.avif?t=1725285365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/ef9376e1c861f665a61ac0c42f184608.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/ef9376e1c861f665a61ac0c42f184608.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Sniff it out like a dog!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/bae791573f4b841e53ce581692c26bb0.poster.avif?t=1725285365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/bae791573f4b841e53ce581692c26bb0.webm?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923210/extras/bae791573f4b841e53ce581692c26bb0.mp4?t=1725285365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take care of your human... play together!",
    "short_description": "A quirky, playful dog sim where you body-swap with a dog. Waking up from a sweet dream, John finds himself in his dog's body! Sniff, bark, beg, and use paw to interact with the townfolks. Can John find a way to return to his human form, or will this unexpected adventure change them forever?",
